zed":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4027677644","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603#issuecomment-4027677644","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603","id":4027677644,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs7wEXvM","user":{"login":"abhishektiwari","id":363839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzgzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/363839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari","html_url":"https://github.com/abhishektiwari","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T23:50:21Z","updated_at":"2026-03-22T00:40:03Z","body":"# Post-Review Checklist for Editor and Authors\n\n## Additional Author Tasks After Review is Complete\n- Double check authors and affiliations (including ORCIDs)\n- Make a release of the software with the latest changes from the review and post the version number here. This is the version that will be used in the JOSS paper.  \n- Archive the release on Zenodo/figshare/etc and post the DOI here.\n- Make sure that the title and author list (including ORCIDs) in the archive match those in the JOSS paper.\n- Make sure that the license listed for the archive is the same as the software license.\n\n## Editor Tasks Prior to Acceptance\n- [x] Double check rendering of paper with ``@editorialbot generate pdf``\n- [x] Specifically check the references with ``@editorialbot check references`` and ask author(s) to update as needed\n- [x] Read the text of the paper and offer comments/corrections (as either a list or a pull request)\n- [x] Check that the title, author list, version tag, and the license are correct in the archived release\n- [x] Set archive DOI with ``@editorialbot set <DOI here> as archive``\n- [x] Set version with ``@editorialbot set <version here> as version``\n- [x] Recommend acceptance with ``@editorialbot recommend-accept``\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4027677644/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4027679626","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603#issuecomment-4027679626","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603","id":4027679626,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs7wEYOK","user":{"login":"abhishektiwari","id":363839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzgzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/363839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari","html_url":"https://github.com/abhishektiwari","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhishektiwari/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T23:51:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T23:51:02Z","body":" @olivierlabayle At this point could you:\n\n- [ ] Double check Paper authors and affiliations (including ORCIDs)\n- [ ] Make a tagged release of your software on Github, and list the version tag of the archived version here.\n- [ ] Archive the reviewed software in Zenodo or a similar service (e.g., figshare, an institutional repository)\n- [ ] Check the archival deposit (e.g., in Zenodo) has the correct title (should match the paper title). \n- [ ] Check the archival deposit (e.g., in Zenodo) has the correct authors and affiliations (should match the paper authors including order). \n- [ ] Check the archival deposit (e.g., in Zenodo) has the correct version (should match the above Github tag you created). \n- [ ] Check the archival deposit (e.g., in Zenodo) has the correct ORCIDs (should match the paper authors). \n- [ ] Make sure that the license listed for the archive is the same as the software license.\n- [ ] Please list the DOI of the archived version here.\n\nOnce those completed, I can then move forward with recommending acceptance of the submission.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4027679626/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4030302774","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603#issuecomment-4030302774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-review