ody (Edits in paper.md):**\nLine 43: Missing article: \"TarGene is Nextflow pipeline\" should be \"TarGene is a Nextflow pipeline\"\nLine 25: Incorrect citation strings. It should be `[@purcell2007plink; @yang2011gcta; @loh2018mixed; @zhou2018efficiently]` [see here](https://pandoc.org/MANUAL.html#extension-citations). \nLine 38–39: Should be \"a framework combining methods from causal inference, machine learning, and semi-parametric statistical theory\" (Oxford comma)\n\n**References (Edits in paper.bib):** Please use {} explicitly to capitalise as by default JOSS formats reference titles as sentence case.\n\nBycroft et al. (2018): \"UK biobank\" should be \"UK Biobank\" (proper name of the database)\nCanela-Xandri et al. (2018):  \"UK biobank.\" should be \"UK Biobank\"\nChen & Guestrin (2016): \"Xgboost\" should be \"XGBoost\"\nUs Research Program Investigators, A. of. (2019): Title to reflect the proper name of the program \"All of Us\". DOI is incorrect it should be `10.1056/NEJMsr1809937` (case sensitive). \n\nOnce done please use to `@editorialbot generate pdf` to check if references are rendered correctly in PDF.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4094347783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4096621933","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603#issuecomment-4096621933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603","id":4096621933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs70LX1t","user":{"login":"olivierlabayle","id":48188914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTg4OTE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48188914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle","html_url":"https://github.com