ttps://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-22T00:42:12Z","updated_at":"2026-03-22T00:42:12Z","body":":wave: @openjournals/bcm-eics, this paper is ready to be accepted and published.\n\nCheck final proof :point_right::page_facing_up: [Download article](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openjournals/joss-papers/joss.09603/joss.09603/10.21105.joss.09603.pdf)\n\nIf the paper PDF and the deposit XML files look good in https://github.com/openjournals/joss-papers/pull/7945, then the AEiC can move forward with accepting the submission by compiling again with the command `@editorialbot accept`","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4105028395/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4110196655","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603#issuecomment-4110196655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603","id":4110196655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs70_J-v","user":{"login":"Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","id":8392709,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzOTI3MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8392709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","html_url":"https://github.com/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T12:17:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T09:08:57Z","body":"@olivierlabayle As AEiC for JOSS I will now help to process this submission for acceptance in JOSS. Below are some final checks, some of which require your attention:\n\n## Checks on repository\n- [x] Project has OSI approved license\n- [x] Project features contributing guidelines\n👉 Your project appears to lack contributing guidelines at the moment (or at least I do not see them from the main repository page or readme). Please work to add these and to mention/link to them in your README. You could for instance create a `CONTRIBUTING.md` file (see here for some examples: https://contributing.md/example/).\n\n## Checks on review issue\n- [x] Review completed\n- [x] Software version tag listed here matches a tagged release\n\n## Checks on archive\n- [x] Archive listed title and authors matches paper\n- [x] Archive listed license matches software license\n- [x] Archive listed version tag matches tagged release (and includes a potential `v`).\n\n## Checks on paper\n- [x] Checked paper formatting - including no text styling in title\n- [x] Check affiliations to make sure country acronyms are not used\n👉 Please spell out `USA` as `United States of America` \n- [x] Checked reference rendering\n- [x] Checked if pre-print citations can be updated by published versions\n- [x] Copyedit pass/checked for typos","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4110196655/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4116462544","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603#issuecomment-4116462544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603","id":4116462544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs71XDvQ","user":{"login":"olivierlabayle","id":48188914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTg4OTE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48188914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle","html_url":"https://github.com/olivierlabayle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivierlabayle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T08:56:24Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T08:56:24Z","body":"Hi @Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman ,\n\n- There is a contributing guide available from the docs: [contributing](ht