:"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot","html_url":"https://github.com/editorialbot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T09:09:47Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T09:09:47Z","body":"```\nDoing it live! Attempting automated processing of paper acceptance...\n```","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4116553685/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4116602033","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603#issuecomment-4116602033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603","id":4116602033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs71Xlyx","user":{"login":"editorialbot","id":89919391,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTE5Mzkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89919391?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot","html_url":"https://github.com/editorialbot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T09:17:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T09:17:11Z","body":"**Ensure proper citation** by uploading a plain text CITATION.cff file to the default branch of your repository.\n\nIf using GitHub, a *Cite this repository* menu will appear in the About section, containing both APA and BibTeX formats. When exported to Zotero using a browser plugin, Zotero will automatically create an entry using the information contained in the .cff file.\n\nYou can copy the contents for your CITATION.cff file here:\n\n<details><summary><strong>CITATION.cff</strong></summary>\n<p>\n\n```\ncff-version: \"1.2.0\"\nauthors:\n- family-names: Labayle\n  given-names: Olivier\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3708-3706\"\n- family-names: Slaughter\n  given-names: Joshua\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1400-6599\"\n- family-names: Roskams-Hieter\n  given-names: Breeshey\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1119-2576\"\n- family-names: Tetley-Campbell\n  given-names: Kelsey\n- family-names: Laan\n  given-names: Mark J.\n  name-particle: van der\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1432-5511\"\n- family-names: Ponting\n  given-names: Chris P.\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0202-7816\"\n- family-names: Khamseh\n  given-names: Ava\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5203-2205\"\n- family-names: Beentjes\n  given-names: Sjoerd Viktor\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7998-4262\"\ndoi: 10.5281/zenodo.19202203\nmessage: If you use this software, please cite our article in the\n  Journal of Open Source Software.\npreferred-citation:\n  authors:\n  - family-names: Labayle\n    given-names: Olivier\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3708-3706\"\n  - family-names: Slaughter\n    given-names: Joshua\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1400-6599\"\n  - family-names: Roskams-Hieter\n    given-names: Breeshey\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1119-2576\"\n  - family-names: Tetley-Campbell\n    given-names: Kelsey\n  - family-names: Laan\n    given-names: Mark J.\n    name-particle: van der\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1432-5511\"\n  - family-names: Ponting\n    given-names: Chris P.\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0202-7816\"\n  - family-names: Khamseh\n    given-names: Ava\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5203-2205\"\n  - family-names: Beentjes\n    given-names: Sjoerd Viktor\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7998-4262\"\n  date-published: 2026-03-24\n  doi: 10.21105/joss.09603\n  issn: 2475-9066\n  issue: 119\n  journal: Journal of Open Source Software\n  publisher:\n    name: Open Journals\n  start: 9603\n  title: \"TarGene: A Nextflow pipeline for the estimation of genetic\n    effects on human traits via semi-parametric methods.\"\n  type: article\n  url: \"https://joss.theoj.org/papers/10.21105/joss.09603\"\n  volume: 11\ntitle: \"TarGene: A Nextflow pipeline for the estimation of genetic\n  effects on human traits via semi-parametric methods.\"\n\n```\n\n</p>\n</details>\n\nIf the repository is not hosted on GitHub, a .cff file can still be uploaded to set your preferred citation. Users will be able to manually copy and paste the citation.\n\nFind more information on .cff files [here](https://github.com/citation-file-format/citation-file-format/blob/main/README.md) and [here](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-citation-files).\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4116602033/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4116602582","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603#issuecomment-4116602582","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/9603","id":4116602582,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs71Xl7W","user":{"login":"editorialbot","id":89919391,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTE5Mzkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89919391?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot","html_url":"https://github.com/editorialbot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T09:17:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T09:17:16Z","body":"🐘🐘🐘 👉 [Toot for this paper](https://fosstodon.org/@joss/116283397594944204) 👈 🐘🐘🐘","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4116602582/reactions","total_count